{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>ולהם</b> Three times in the Masorah: here, and regarding Joseph: ולהם לכדם, and ולהם ולגמליהם — without number. Just as regarding Joseph, who ate by himself and the Egyptians by themselves, so too Noah and his sons and the wild animals and the domesticated animals — each one by himself, each with its own food. And this is the meaning of ולהם ולגמליהם — that he brought vines for the elephants and food for the camels, and likewise for each and every species."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:44.441541161Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}